sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor A as Attorney
    participant G as Ingress gateway
    participant F as Workspace frontend
    participant R as Research runtime
    participant B as Tool bridge
    participant C as Matter core
    participant M as Local model host
    participant L as Memory lane

    A->>G: question, scoped to one matter
    G->>F: static assets and proxy
    F->>R: run request
    R->>L: recall prior context
    L-->>R: session summaries and decisions
    R->>B: list documents, read document
    B->>C: authenticated call with matter scope
    C-->>B: documents, extraction state
    B-->>R: tool result
    R->>M: grounded prompt
    M-->>R: streamed answer with citations
    R->>L: remember outcome
    R-->>F: answer, citations, artifact list
    F-->>A: rendered answer and exports
